  "item6_family_B_validation_scope": {
    "statement": "RUBRIC_B's CONSTRUCT and threshold robustness are validated: sensitivity 0.979, specificity 0.923 against pre-registered adjudicated labels on 234 items, separation stable in [+0.802, +0.821] across 41 cutoffs, AUROC 0.962. What is NOT measured is TRANSFER of sensitivity from E6's memorised training turns -- crisp, explicit exonerations -- to E7's sampled paraphrase responses, which are hedged. High sensitivity on crisp text is necessary but not sufficient for sensitivity on hedged text. This gap is unclosed and is stated next to every Family-B rate."
